<a href="{{#if (eq story.status 'private')}}/dashboard{{else}}/stories{{/if}}" class="back-link"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{#if (eq story.status 'private')}}My stories{{else}}Discover stories{{/if}}</a>
<article class="reading-layout"><div class="reading-main"><header class="reading-heading"><span class="status-badge status-{{story.status}}"><i class="fa-solid {{#if (eq story.status 'private')}}fa-lock{{else}}fa-globe{{/if}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{story.status}} story</span><h1>{{story.title}}</h1><div class="reading-meta"><span>{{formatDate story.createdAt 'MMMM D, YYYY'}}</span><span aria-hidden="true">·</span><span>{{readingTime story.body}} min read</span>{{{editIcon story.user user story._id false}}}</div></header><div class="story-body">{{{story.body}}}</div><div class="end-mark" aria-hidden="true">* &nbsp; * &nbsp; *</div><a href="/stories" class="text-link">Discover another story <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div><aside class="author-card" aria-label="About the author"><p class="eyebrow">The voice behind the story</p><span class="avatar avatar-large">{{#if story.user.image}}<img src="{{story.user.image}}" alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">{{else}}<i class="fa-regular fa-user" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{/if}}</span><h2>{{story.user.displayName}}</h2><p>There’s always another story to tell.</p><a href="/stories/user/{{story.user._id}}" class="text-link">More from {{story.user.firstName}} <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></aside></article>
